                                                "sense_id": "7d0b4f01-0012-3958-9e9a-90a0f81baf1d",
                                                "text": "Fast forward to Chase's base. Where Chase hit a homer, first at bat. Becca thrived off being sexy, having sex, watching sex."
                                            },
