                                                "sense_id": "7d0b4f01-0012-3958-9e9a-90a0f81baf1d",
                                                "text": "“So you hit a homer, huh?” she asked, confused by his misery.\nColm nodded. “Best sex I've had in a long time. Maybe ever.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
